  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The magnitude of magnetic induction at mid-point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> due to current arrangement as shown in figure&nbsp;will be</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6bf3948f-39c3-4a8d-addd-e51319219d8d-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 171px;\" />.</p>",
